port mail/py-pymilter
type port
reason "DragonFly: take miltermodule.c's RFC 2553 IPv6 path (arpa/inet.h, inet_ntop)"

# dragonfly/patch-miltermodule.c: the RFC 2553 check lists FreeBSD but not
# DragonFly, so <arpa/inet.h> was never included and inet_ntop() was an
# implicit declaration, which setup.py turns into an error.
